ent-SandboxNuclearMissile = SS-N-40 'Atlant' nuclear cruise missile
    .desc = A high-velocity cruise missile equipped with multi-kiloton nuclear warhead, capable of disabling any ship in a single blow. Almost unstoppable, and looks identical to a normal 8K30 on radar. This is a weapon of mass destruction, the destroyer of worlds. Hopefully you don't need to use it.
